Show worktrees | Your account | Show worktrees for pinned sessions and those used in the last 100 hours (changed, running, opened or worked in); others fold them behind their count. Your own fold or unfold of a session holds until you next open it. | hours
Archive after | Sessions without activity for 2 days move to Archived (pinned and running ones never do). | days
