=== chromium: search: Ctrl+K: the session's settings, recent sessions, commands ===
focus in the filter: control-input
-- This session --
> Set model | DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Ctrl+L
  Set thinking | provider's default Alt+T
  Set verbosity | normal Ctrl+O
  Switch host | <HOSTNAME>
  Set mode | auto Alt+M
  Context and cost | 0% · $0.00
-- Recent sessions --
  Port the tmux tests | <age> · <CWD>
  Release notes | <age> · <CWD>
  Deploy checklist | <age> · <CWD>
-- Commands --
  /new | start a new session
  /settings | appearance, sessions, new sessions' defaults, models, git hosting and your account; a section opens at it (Ctrl+,)
  /review | the review page, the changes file by file to approve, comment on and edit (Alt+R): of the session's worktree or another (its branch, path or name), against its base or REV; /review BASE [instructions] (HEAD: the uncommitted changes) has the model review them for prioritised findings
  /files | browse, preview, upload and download files where the tools run (Ctrl+Shift+F)
  /help | show commands and keys, or a command's usage
↑↓ move
↵ open
⌫ back
esc close
